 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2021-02-25",
   "text": "Patient Access to Higher Quality Health Care Act of 2021\n This bill repeals provisions under the Stark law (i.e., the Physician Self-Referral Law) that limit, for purposes of Medicare participation, self-referrals by newly constructed or expanded physician-owned hospitals."
  }
